From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:40:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Route 208 and 209's edges filled from their own pieces (SDK_PORT_3DS)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Route 208's west map past its south edge: its mountain's slopes drawn on
south in their columns only (sPortExtrudeColumns), the sea's filler there
drawn at the river's height (sPortSceneryHeights) so its waves go on from
the river's, and the map's own pieces drawn again moved (sPortMapPieces,
new: a copy of the loaded map's model whose shapes hold only the pieces):
the lowest slope on south, the waterline trims of its north river beside
it and by the forest, the east one's top turned east with the ledge's own
rounded corner (turned half round, NitroPort_Gx3dSurveyTurned). Route
209's river, which ran up to its map's north edge with no bank, closed
with the map's own bank and rounded corners from it and the map east.
---
diff --git a/src/overlay005/land_data.c b/src/overlay005/land_data.c
index d9633576..ee85481c 100644
